# src/ -- Reusable ETL and validation logic.

# Engineering principle: the DAG describes ORCHESTRATION. Reusable ETL and
# validation logic belongs here (outside the DAG file) when it is appropriate.
#
# Part 2 of the activity will place the real Great Expectations validation and
# the ETL transformation steps in this folder, keeping the DAG responsible only
# for when and in what order those operations run.